{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 的少数感受词过度具象，甚至容易补出原叙事没有明确发生的情节，例如“年少时初恋的下午”“刚刚答了声是”，可能让观众误读人物关系。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的优势是把人物关系中的关键动作、心理顾虑和情绪转折直接突出，观众可以先抓住主线，再通过随音乐出现的细小感受理解情绪如何变化；X 的右侧短词虽然容易扫到，但彼此较为并列，和人物叙事的因果对应不够直接。Y 的交替排布和分时出现也让前后情绪更像连续发展的过程，感受更有层次，而不是事后贴上一组形容词；主要需要克制的是少数过度具体、可能干扰故事理解的联想。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7ee6a619-a69b-4efc-8e8f-c6c52834ed2b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T043104658608Z", "elapsed_seconds": 81.219, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T04:32:25.901833+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fd714caacb9db466fc5086469cf0ae129e1d31b14a97a298b14926bc704d5950", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\cha